## .gitignore for .NET / Visual Studio / WPF solutions

# Build results
**/bin/Debug/
**/bin/Release/
**/obj/Debug/
**/obj/Release/
x64/
x86/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# Visual Studio files
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs

# JetBrains Rider & VS Code
.idea/
*.DotSettings.user
.vscode/

# User-specific files
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscacheAGENTS.md
*.sln.docstates

# Windows thumbnail & desktop caches
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# App data generated files
settings.json
*.log

# Release artifacts (distribute via GitHub Releases)
release/*.zip
release/*.txt
release/**/*.exe
release/**/*.dll
release/OnceHuman*/
!release/README.md
AGENTS.md
